    <!-- Text sections for TOS   -->
    <string name="tos_p1">All users who join an event\'s waitlist will be entered into a random draw once registration closes. Every entrant has an <b>equal chance</b> of being selected.</string>
    <string name="tos_p2">Selected entrants will be notified to claim their spot; if they don\'t respond or decline, someone from the waiting list will be chosen.</string>
    <string name="tos_p3">Everyone who joins the draw will be notified of the results. The lottery process is fully automated and impartial. <b>Event organizers and administrators cannot influence lottery outcomes.</b></string>
    <string name="tos_p4">The information you provide is used only for event registration and communication within the app. It will never be used or shared for any external purpose.</string>
    <string name="tos_p5">Organizers are responsible for ensuring that event details such as time, date, and requirements are accurate before publishing.</string>
    <string name="tos_p6">By pressing <b>I agree</b>, you acknowledge that selection is based on chance and agree to these terms. Entering the lottery does not guarantee a spot in the event.</string>
